## 7. Sunset & Customer Continuity Plan
Detail the orderly wind-down protocol if governance sunsets this instrument:
- **Notice Period**: [e.g., 90 days]
- **Outstanding SLA Obligations**: How existing support commitments will be honored or refunded.
- **Wind-Down Reserve Allocation**: Funded reserve to cover residual operating costs during wind-down.
